<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?><?xml-stylesheet href="http://www.blogger.com/styles/atom.css" type="text/css"?><feed xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom' xmlns:openSearch='http://a9.com/-/spec/opensearchrss/1.0/' xmlns:gd="http://schemas.google.com/g/2005"><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post4150183609721336941..comments</id><updated>2017-04-13T04:47:21.148-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Comments on Pro Libertate: Your &quot;Duty&quot; To Protect and Serve the Police</title><link rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#feed' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/feeds/comments/default'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4150183609721336941/comments/default'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/your-duty-to-protect-and-serve-police.html'/><link rel="hub" href="http://pubsubhubbub.appspot.com/"/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='19' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-5rhFUXs_62I/VgVL2E3rMII/AAAAAAAAMJ4/cjJOyI7W208/s220/Photo%2BRon%2BPaul%2BLiberty%2BReport.jpg'/></author><generator version='7.00' uri='http://www.blogger.com'>Blogger</generator><openSearch:totalResults>21</openSearch:totalResults><openSearch:startIndex>1</openSearch:startIndex><openSearch:itemsPerPage>25</openSearch:itemsPerPage><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4904354789762765422</id><published>2014-02-26T12:07:20.637-07:00</published><updated>2014-02-26T12:07:20.637-07:00</updated><title type='text'>And by the way, you probably didnt know, but my fr...</title><content type='html'>And by the way, you probably didnt know, but my friend Melissa Meekma, the female deputy who was shot during the shootout in El Dorado County, she committed suicide shortly after the &amp;quot;wax melodramatic about the dangers...&amp;quot; shootout. </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4150183609721336941/comments/default/4904354789762765422'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4150183609721336941/comments/default/4904354789762765422'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/your-duty-to-protect-and-serve-police.html?showComment=1393441640637#c4904354789762765422' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/your-duty-to-protect-and-serve-police.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4150183609721336941' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4150183609721336941' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1335583510"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 26, 2014 at 12:07 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4411109686645536203</id><published>2014-02-26T12:01:41.693-07:00</published><updated>2014-02-26T12:01:41.693-07:00</updated><title type='text'>I agree with you about the institution itself, but...</title><content type='html'>I agree with you about the institution itself, but not to the point of picking out individuals (agenda in hand) and condemning them without knowing the facts, even when they are right in front of them.  That&amp;#39;s doing the same thing you accuse the &amp;quot;institution&amp;quot; you are criticizing. &amp;quot;Bad cops&amp;quot; putting innocent people in jail... Condemning innocent cops and ruining their lives.  When I have ride-a-longs, I avoided putting my ride-a-long in danger.  I&amp;#39;m talking about getting to know the officer and see that he or she is not the monster portrayed.  Try doing a ride-a-long in a big city, not a small town in say...Idaho.  Loggers, now that&amp;#39;s crazy dangerous!  When I was a Los Angeles cop, I used to hang out with the firemen.  I used to tell them they were crazy going into a burning building, they would say I was crazy going into a bank robbery. I think we agree for the most part, and we both feel strong about our subjects.  No problem. You take care.  </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4150183609721336941/comments/default/4411109686645536203'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4150183609721336941/comments/default/4411109686645536203'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/your-duty-to-protect-and-serve-police.html?showComment=1393441301693#c4411109686645536203' title=''/><author><name>REDMTN</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14359800256433259794</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/your-duty-to-protect-and-serve-police.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4150183609721336941' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4150183609721336941' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-289984192"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 26, 2014 at 12:01 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5082359072858240341</id><published>2014-02-25T12:21:38.137-07:00</published><updated>2014-02-25T12:21:38.137-07:00</updated><title type='text'>I&amp;#39;m sincerely glad that Yaws wasn&amp;#39;t killed...</title><content type='html'>I&amp;#39;m sincerely glad that Yaws wasn&amp;#39;t killed. I&amp;#39;m likewise happy to see that you appear to agree that the lawsuit was a bad idea. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;My view is not that all, or even most, police officers are exceptionally bad, but rather that the institution itself is at best morally infirm and tends to encourage bad behavior. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;In my experience -- which includes more than a few ride-alongs -- most police officers are severely risk-aversive. This is all the more remarkable given that law enforcement is by no means an unusually risky occupation. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Police officers who wax melodramatic about the dangers they confront should shadow a logger, a farmer, or a commercial fisherman for a week in order to appreciate the risks run by people in the productive sector. </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4150183609721336941/comments/default/5082359072858240341'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4150183609721336941/comments/default/5082359072858240341'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/your-duty-to-protect-and-serve-police.html?showComment=1393356098137#c5082359072858240341' title=''/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='18' src='http://2.bp.blogspot.com/-bAwUsWSNJqY/Ut1X_S7xqyI/AAAAAAAAKBs/c-w-CbO5t1c/s220/New%2BProfile%2BPic.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/your-duty-to-protect-and-serve-police.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4150183609721336941' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4150183609721336941' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1344012943"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 25, 2014 at 12:21 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-557488458145835916</id><published>2014-02-25T12:11:13.363-07:00</published><updated>2014-02-25T12:11:13.363-07:00</updated><title type='text'>1. I was there during the shootout in El Dorado Co...</title><content type='html'>1. I was there during the shootout in El Dorado County, I dragged injured Deputy Yaws out of the line of fire and administered first aid to him.  &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;2. There was no friendly fire, all Deputies including the K-9 were shot with 00 buck (That&amp;#39;s a shotgun round) for all or most of you who care. Only two shotguns were used, one by the suspect and one by the Deputy who shot the suspect stopping the threat, and that was after the Deputies were shot. SWAT didn&amp;#39;t arrive until after the shooting and the suspect was dead and the Deputies were flown to the hospital.   &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;3. The suspects mother bought and supplied the guns for her drug addicted mentally disabled son.  (I personally would not have filed a lawsuit though, even though it was just a statement). &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;4. I don&amp;#39;t agree with most of you that believe all cops are bad, we have bad apples just like any occupation, and they are few.  It seems in my experience, the people who bash the cops are people who would run full speed away from danger.  Go on a ride-a-long and see what non TV cops really do. I got a better idea, go through the academy and become a cop,,,I didn&amp;#39;t think so...</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4150183609721336941/comments/default/557488458145835916'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4150183609721336941/comments/default/557488458145835916'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/your-duty-to-protect-and-serve-police.html?showComment=1393355473363#c557488458145835916' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/your-duty-to-protect-and-serve-police.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4150183609721336941' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4150183609721336941' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1805374128"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 25, 2014 at 12:11 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7744824372725259021</id><published>2012-08-11T18:40:18.908-06:00</published><updated>2012-08-11T18:40:18.908-06:00</updated><title type='text'>That the victims, those raped to pay for the salar...</title><content type='html'>&lt;i&gt;That the victims, those raped to pay for the salaries of their abusers, will que up to witness a tax leech put into the ground.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The EPA should be called on this one.  Burying the mortal remains of an armed tax leech is tantamount to toxic waste dumping.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4150183609721336941/comments/default/7744824372725259021'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4150183609721336941/comments/default/7744824372725259021'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/your-duty-to-protect-and-serve-police.html?showComment=1344732018908#c7744824372725259021' title=''/><author><name>liberranter</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/00555275410576294081</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/your-duty-to-protect-and-serve-police.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4150183609721336941' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4150183609721336941' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-529179912"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 11, 2012 at 6:40 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5731829205502443547</id><published>2012-08-10T14:11:58.080-06:00</published><updated>2012-08-10T14:11:58.080-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Great piece, Will. My son, Erik Scott, was murdere...</title><content type='html'>Great piece, Will. My son, Erik Scott, was murdered by stupid, scared cops on July 10, 2010. An outstanding analyses of the Las Vegas Metro police cover-up (which was incredibly sloppy) was done by former-LEO Mike McDaniels and posted as a series on his Stately McDaniel Manor blog. I&amp;#39;ve reposted Mike&amp;#39;s latest, which examines the bogus &amp;quot;Two-Gun&amp;quot; police fantasy, on Erik&amp;#39;s memorial blog: http://erikbscottmemorialblog.blogspot.com/</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4150183609721336941/comments/default/5731829205502443547'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4150183609721336941/comments/default/5731829205502443547'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/your-duty-to-protect-and-serve-police.html?showComment=1344629518080#c5731829205502443547' title=''/><author><name>Ranger</name><uri>http://erikbscottmemorialblog.blogspot.com/</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/your-duty-to-protect-and-serve-police.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4150183609721336941' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4150183609721336941' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1987792049"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 10, 2012 at 2:11 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5921316112973817719</id><published>2012-08-10T14:11:20.097-06:00</published><updated>2012-08-10T14:11:20.097-06:00</updated><title type='text'>When was the last time you saw thousands of people...</title><content type='html'>When was the last time you saw thousands of people lining up at a funeral for a trucker or fisherman who does honest labor for their family?  That&amp;#39;s how sick this is: That the victims, those raped to pay for the salaries of their abusers, will que up to witness a tax leech put into the ground.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4150183609721336941/comments/default/5921316112973817719'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4150183609721336941/comments/default/5921316112973817719'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/your-duty-to-protect-and-serve-police.html?showComment=1344629480097#c5921316112973817719' title=''/><author><name>MoT</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/your-duty-to-protect-and-serve-police.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4150183609721336941' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4150183609721336941' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-503858410"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 10, 2012 at 2:11 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3649474811834035526</id><published>2012-08-10T12:59:54.005-06:00</published><updated>2012-08-10T12:59:54.005-06:00</updated><title type='text'>The shrinking police budget won&amp;#39;t (at least im...</title><content type='html'>The shrinking police budget won&amp;#39;t (at least immediately) result in fewer cops (hired guns who don&amp;#39;t have any more constitutional rights than the rest of us) but results in the cops putting the squeeze on more and more of us to cover their pay and benefits -- through more tickets and seizures.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Most people in this country of swallowed the TV propaganda about cops being our &amp;#39;saviors.&amp;#39;  It&amp;#39;s not until people become the victims of severe police abuse that they realize the truth -- cops are thugs who have a license to rob, beat and kill you.  Welcome to the real world.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4150183609721336941/comments/default/3649474811834035526'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4150183609721336941/comments/default/3649474811834035526'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/your-duty-to-protect-and-serve-police.html?showComment=1344625194005#c3649474811834035526' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/your-duty-to-protect-and-serve-police.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4150183609721336941' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4150183609721336941' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1947465864"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 10, 2012 at 12:59 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8505391527041401278</id><published>2012-08-09T22:36:19.664-06:00</published><updated>2012-08-09T22:36:19.664-06:00</updated><title type='text'>What was she supposed to do spank him, I lul&amp;#39;d...</title><content type='html'>What was she supposed to do spank him, I lul&amp;#39;d. The same thing in the second case how is the mother supposed to stop a grown man from acquiring weapons. A stern lecture? Send him to his room without supper? The one good thing about the collapse of the glorious hopetopia is the budget for police forces will shrink and there won&amp;#39;t be so many donut snorters. Also when the SHTF the state sanctioned gang members will be looking out for their own and family but I am sure all the readers of Pro Libertate knew this already. To protect and serve...the status quo and vital corporate interests.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4150183609721336941/comments/default/8505391527041401278'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4150183609721336941/comments/default/8505391527041401278'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/your-duty-to-protect-and-serve-police.html?showComment=1344573379664#c8505391527041401278' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/your-duty-to-protect-and-serve-police.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4150183609721336941' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4150183609721336941' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1104160875"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 9, 2012 at 10:36 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1585721485151948586</id><published>2012-08-09T20:36:40.926-06:00</published><updated>2012-08-09T20:36:40.926-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Clint Richardson does an excellent job of defining...</title><content type='html'>Clint Richardson does an excellent job of defining &amp;quot;To Protect And Serve&amp;quot;.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&amp;quot;What does this obtuse and open-ended catch-phrase actually mean?&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;http://realitybloger.wordpress.com/2012/08/08/to-protect-and-serve</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4150183609721336941/comments/default/1585721485151948586'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4150183609721336941/comments/default/1585721485151948586'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/your-duty-to-protect-and-serve-police.html?showComment=1344566200926#c1585721485151948586' title=''/><author><name>oooorgle</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/your-duty-to-protect-and-serve-police.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4150183609721336941' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4150183609721336941' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1422301245"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 9, 2012 at 8:36 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-9012667769225371749</id><published>2012-08-09T15:13:23.777-06:00</published><updated>2012-08-09T15:13:23.777-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Wow, nicely done. I loved your analysis of the exa...</title><content type='html'>Wow, nicely done. I loved your analysis of the exaggerations and dissimulations employed by to police to show their subjects in most damaging way possible, even to the extent of what amounts to outright fiction.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;And then, the way you did the EXACT SAME THING in your last two paragraphs... genius!!! Your characterization of Holder is so ditto-ized it&amp;#39;s nothing short of laughable.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;So, you might say I&amp;#39;m ambivalent on this article... heh</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4150183609721336941/comments/default/9012667769225371749'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4150183609721336941/comments/default/9012667769225371749'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/your-duty-to-protect-and-serve-police.html?showComment=1344546803777#c9012667769225371749' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/your-duty-to-protect-and-serve-police.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4150183609721336941' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4150183609721336941' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-135368784"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 9, 2012 at 3:13 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-212819425614450017</id><published>2012-08-09T14:02:55.556-06:00</published><updated>2012-08-09T14:02:55.556-06:00</updated><title type='text'>The law says police can lie to you, but not vice v...</title><content type='html'>The law says police can lie to you, but not vice versa. The law says police have a duty to protect government, but not you. Now they prey on whomever they can, even widowed victims of violence, or grieving mothers. They will use any excuse to &amp;quot;seize assets&amp;quot; for even petty crimes, yet never stop big league criminals like Eric Holder. With &amp;quot;public servants&amp;quot; like these, we need to fire them!</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4150183609721336941/comments/default/212819425614450017'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4150183609721336941/comments/default/212819425614450017'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/your-duty-to-protect-and-serve-police.html?showComment=1344542575556#c212819425614450017' title=''/><author><name>David McElroy</name><uri>http://www.onlyway.com</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/your-duty-to-protect-and-serve-police.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4150183609721336941' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4150183609721336941' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1368730295"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 9, 2012 at 2:02 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-744521976145657782</id><published>2012-08-09T12:41:10.399-06:00</published><updated>2012-08-09T12:41:10.399-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Sounds a lot like what happened to Mrs Surratt.</title><content type='html'>Sounds a lot like what happened to Mrs Surratt.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4150183609721336941/comments/default/744521976145657782'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4150183609721336941/comments/default/744521976145657782'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/your-duty-to-protect-and-serve-police.html?showComment=1344537670399#c744521976145657782' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/your-duty-to-protect-and-serve-police.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4150183609721336941' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4150183609721336941' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-153310540"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 9, 2012 at 12:41 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6365360711461275474</id><published>2012-08-09T12:05:43.032-06:00</published><updated>2012-08-09T12:05:43.032-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Another New Hampshire travesty.  Again, so much fo...</title><content type='html'>Another New Hampshire travesty.  Again, so much for &amp;quot;Project Free (HAH!) State.&amp;quot;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4150183609721336941/comments/default/6365360711461275474'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4150183609721336941/comments/default/6365360711461275474'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/your-duty-to-protect-and-serve-police.html?showComment=1344535543032#c6365360711461275474' title=''/><author><name>liberranter</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/00555275410576294081</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/your-duty-to-protect-and-serve-police.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4150183609721336941' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4150183609721336941' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-529179912"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 9, 2012 at 12:05 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3557770917467018902</id><published>2012-08-09T11:37:47.348-06:00</published><updated>2012-08-09T11:37:47.348-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Bankruptcy and unemployment of the Standing Army c...</title><content type='html'>Bankruptcy and unemployment of the Standing Army cannot come soon enough.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The &amp;quot;professional police force&amp;quot; has been a disaster. It is time to abolish it and go back to private security.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4150183609721336941/comments/default/3557770917467018902'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4150183609721336941/comments/default/3557770917467018902'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/your-duty-to-protect-and-serve-police.html?showComment=1344533867348#c3557770917467018902' title=''/><author><name>Curt-</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/15378506296755879713</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='18' src='http://2.bp.blogspot.com/_XIn4lt089ZE/TVAy7dYa07I/AAAAAAAAAAM/WCRhcM89Fws/s220/r1c2.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/your-duty-to-protect-and-serve-police.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4150183609721336941' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4150183609721336941' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-688653193"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 9, 2012 at 11:37 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5645754738328716933</id><published>2012-08-09T09:01:18.375-06:00</published><updated>2012-08-09T09:01:18.375-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Police unions are attempting to shift the costs of...</title><content type='html'>Police unions are attempting to shift the costs of the risk&lt;br /&gt;of personal injury to property owners even where that&lt;br /&gt;risk is foreseeable as in the line of duty.  In other words,&lt;br /&gt;they want us to &lt;i&gt;insure&lt;/i&gt; their livelihood in &lt;i&gt;addition&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br /&gt;to paying their salaries via our property taxes. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;In today&amp;#39;s climate where the common law is being overturned &lt;br /&gt;whenever and wherever possible, I wouldn&amp;#39;t rule this out &lt;br /&gt;but when the shift does come and we &lt;i&gt;are&lt;/i&gt; forced to&lt;br /&gt;purchase such a policy it will called a &lt;b&gt;tax&lt;/b&gt;, not insurance.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4150183609721336941/comments/default/5645754738328716933'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4150183609721336941/comments/default/5645754738328716933'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/your-duty-to-protect-and-serve-police.html?showComment=1344524478375#c5645754738328716933' title=''/><author><name>willb</name><uri>http://pmask.com</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/your-duty-to-protect-and-serve-police.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4150183609721336941' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4150183609721336941' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1565557136"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 9, 2012 at 9:01 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8610194663459150659</id><published>2012-08-09T06:10:55.135-06:00</published><updated>2012-08-09T06:10:55.135-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Damn shame the fall of our society is becoming so ...</title><content type='html'>Damn shame the fall of our society is becoming so apparent.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4150183609721336941/comments/default/8610194663459150659'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4150183609721336941/comments/default/8610194663459150659'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/your-duty-to-protect-and-serve-police.html?showComment=1344514255135#c8610194663459150659' title=''/><author><name>vizfact</name><uri>http://www.vizfact.com/</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/your-duty-to-protect-and-serve-police.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4150183609721336941' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4150183609721336941' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1487585218"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 9, 2012 at 6:10 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3255786909920911855</id><published>2012-08-08T21:53:26.064-06:00</published><updated>2012-08-08T21:53:26.064-06:00</updated><title type='text'>In Russia, police sue you!&#xa;&#xa;Oh, wait....</title><content type='html'>In Russia, police sue you!&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Oh, wait....</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4150183609721336941/comments/default/3255786909920911855'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4150183609721336941/comments/default/3255786909920911855'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/your-duty-to-protect-and-serve-police.html?showComment=1344484406064#c3255786909920911855' title=''/><author><name>Ken Head</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/01271655835907055201</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#