er.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4150183609721336941' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1303755257"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 8, 2012 at 6:16 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-138541447326042127</id><published>2012-08-08T18:15:51.853-06:00</published><updated>2012-08-08T18:15:51.853-06:00</updated><title type='text'>I do not agree with property seizure unless it is ...</title><content type='html'>I do not agree with property seizure unless it is evidence. It is a violation of the 4th amendment.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4150183609721336941/comments/default/138541447326042127'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4150183609721336941/comments/default/138541447326042127'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/your-duty-to-protect-and-serve-police.html?showComment=1344471351853#c138541447326042127' title=''/><author><name>RhondaO</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/09316500448030627934</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/your-duty-to-protect-and-serve-police.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4150183609721336941' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4150183609721336941' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1303755257"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 8, 2012 at 6:15 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6866078059567617048</id><published>2012-08-08T17:37:39.338-06:00</published><updated>2012-08-08T17:37:39.338-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Another great piece, Will... I live in NH, and fol...</title><content type='html'>Another great piece, Will... I live in NH, and followed the first story... I knew before it was reported that they were going to seize all property from the mother... When events like this happen, its like reading one of your writings in real time... Hopefully that fact will change someday...</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4150183609721336941/comments/default/6866078059567617048'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4150183609721336941/comments/default/6866078059567617048'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/your-duty-to-protect-and-serve-police.html?showComment=1344469059338#c6866078059567617048' title=''/><author><name>Syntek99</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/your-duty-to-protect-and-serve-police.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4150183609721336941' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4150183609721336941' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-268394042"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 8, 2012 at 5:37 PM"/></entry></feed>